ing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/embedding#related-documentation","content":"Openai Function Base Class","locale":"en"},"202":{"id":"/en/docs/db","page_id":"/en/docs/db","type":"page","content":"What Is Zvec?","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","Introduction"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db","locale":"en"},"203":{"id":"/en/docs/db-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"An open-source, in-process vector database by Alibaba — lightweight, lightning-fast, and battle-tested.","locale":"en"},"204":{"id":"/en/docs/db-1","page_id":"/en/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"Key Features","locale":"en"},"205":{"id":"/en/docs/db-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db#what-is-next","content":"What is Next?","locale":"en"},"206":{"id":"/en/docs/db-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"**Zvec** is an open-source, fast, lightweight, and feature-rich vector database that runs entirely **in-process** — no server, daemon, or external infrastructure required. Just install the package and start indexing and querying vectors right away 🚀.","locale":"en"},"207":{"id":"/en/docs/db-4","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"Vector databases are commonly used to power AI applications like semantic search, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), recommendation systems, and other similarity-based workflows.","locale":"en"},"208":{"id":"/en/docs/db-5","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"Zvec can serve as a **standalone vector database** for end-to-end storage and search, or it can be **seamlessly integrated into existing search systems** (such as traditional SQL databases) as a dedicated vector search engine.","locale":"en"},"209":{"id":"/en/docs/db-6","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"**Batt