ep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"Reset Safely","locale":"en"},"888":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"Start with three checks:","locale":"en"},"889":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"The npm installer requires Node.js 14.14 or newer; `zg` itself runs as a native executable:","locale":"en"},"890":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"If npm succeeds but `zg` is still missing, add npm's global binary directory to your shell `PATH`.","locale":"en"},"891":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"If npm skipped the package's installation scripts, enable them and run `npm rebuild -g @zvec/zvec-grep --allow-scripts=@zvec/zvec-grep --foreground-scripts` to materialize the native executable.","locale":"en"},"892":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Run commands from the intended workspace root:","locale":"en"},"893":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Use `--rebuild` when changing the embedding model or when status reports an incompatible index. For an incompatible index, specify the desired model and scan rules again; existing data is not migrated in place.","locale":"en"},"894":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--rg` for known text, identifiers, paths, or regex.","locale":"en"},"895":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--fts` for known terms that need ranking.","locale":"en"},"896":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use the default hybrid query when wording or location is unknown.","locale":"en"},"897":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Restrict broad workspaces with `-g`, `-t`, or `-T`.","locale":"en"},"898":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Confirm that the content is indexed and the model fits it.","locale":"en"},"899":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"See Search Guide, Supported Content, and Embedding Models.","locale":"en"},"900":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"This applies only when using `--mode server` or an HTTP MCP connection. Default stdio Agent integrations manage the service automatically.","locale":"en"},"901":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"Run `zg --server run` when you need foreground logs. See Local Server for lifecycle, client mode, listen address, and authentication.","locale":"en"},"902":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"Restart the Agent or open a new session. Exact identifiers and filenames may correctly use its native grep instead of Zvec-Grep. See Connect AI Agents.","locale":"en"},"903":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Inspect or grant the separate workspace authorization:","locale":"en"},"904":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Use `--allow-remote` for one command, or choose a local model when content must not leave the machine.","locale":"en"},"905":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"`--drop` deletes the workspace index, not the source files. Indexed search remains unavailable until you build another index.","locale":"en"},"906":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"When reporting a problem, include 