on syntax with boolean operators","locale":"en"},"2307":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-44","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#match-string","content":"Use `match_string` for natural language queries. The input is plain text — no special syntax or escaping is needed. It is tokenized using the same tokenizer configured on the field, and tokens are combined using the default operator (`OR` by default).","locale":"en"},"2308":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-45","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#match-string","content":"With the default `OR` operator, this returns documents containing **either** \"machine\" **or** \"learning\" (or both), ranked by BM25 relevance.","locale":"en"},"2309":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-46","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"Use `query_string` for advanced queries with explicit boolean operators, required/excluded terms, and exact phrase matching.","locale":"en"},"2310":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-47","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"With the default `OR` operator, a document must contain \"learning\" and must exclude \"neural\". Matching the optional phrase \"vector search\" also contributes to its score.","locale":"en"},"2311":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-48","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"`query_string` and `match_string` are **mutually exclusive** — you must provide exactly one of them in each `Fts` object.","locale":"en"},"2312":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-49","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"The following operators are supported in `query_string` expressions:","locale":"en"},"2313":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-50","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Syntax","locale":"en"},"2314":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-51","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"2315":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-52","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Example","locale":"en"},"2316":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-53","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`term`","locale":"en"},"2317":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-54","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Match a single term","locale":"en"},"2318":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-55","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`vector`","locale":"en"},"2319":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-56","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`\"phrase\"`","locale":"en"},"2320":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-57","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/