#results","content":"`ZVecDoc[]`","locale":"en"},"2562":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-114","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#results","content":"The documents in the group, ordered by vector relevance.","locale":"en"},"2563":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-115","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#results","content":"Groups are ordered by the relevance of the first document in each group. The direction of distance or similarity scores depends on the metric used by the vector field. For example, higher inner product scores usually indicate greater relevance, while lower L2 and cosine distance scores usually indicate greater relevance.","locale":"en"},"2564":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-116","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#results","content":"The grouping field value is returned independently of the output fields. You can use it to identify a group even when the grouping field is not included in the output fields.","locale":"en"},"2565":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-117","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search supports only single-vector search. It does not support full-text search or multi-vector search.","locale":"en"},"2566":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-118","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"The grouping field cannot be a vector or array field.","locale":"en"},"2567":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-119","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search currently does not support IVF, DiskANN, or Vamana vector indexes.","locale":"en"},"2568":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-120","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search cannot be used with vector refinement (refiner).","locale":"en"},"2569":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-121","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search is best-effort. Depending on the data distribution and search conditions, the actual number of groups and documents per group may be lower than the specified values. When there are not enough candidates, Zvec prioritizes the number of groups.","locale":"en"},"2570":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-122","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Increasing the number of groups or documents per group requires collecting and sorting more candidates and typically increases query latency.","locale":"en"},"2571":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","type":"page","content":"Vector + Filter","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","Guides","Data Operations","Query"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","locale":"en"},"2572":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid#prerequisites","content":"Prerequisites","locale":"en"},"2573":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations