ocs/db/embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/embedding#相关文档","content":"Sentence Transformers Base Class","locale":"zh"},"3005":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/embedding-131","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/embedding#相关文档","content":"Qwen Function Base Class","locale":"zh"},"3006":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/embedding-132","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/embedding#相关文档","content":"Openai Function Base Class","locale":"zh"},"3007":{"id":"/zh/docs/db","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","type":"page","content":"关于 Zvec","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db","locale":"zh"},"3008":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"开源嵌入式向量数据库 — 本地部署、高可靠、低延迟。","locale":"zh"},"3009":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"核心特性","locale":"zh"},"3010":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh"},"3011":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"**Zvec** 是一款开源、高性能、轻量级且功能丰富的向量数据库，完全以**进程内**(嵌入式)方式运行 — 无需服务器、守护进程或外部软件设施。安装完成后，即刻进行向量索引与查询 🚀。","locale":"zh"},"3012":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"向量数据库广泛用于驱动语义搜索、检索增强生成（RAG）、推荐系统及其他基于相似度的 AI 应用。","locale":"zh"},"3013":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"Zvec 既可作为**独立的向量数据库**进行端到端的存储与检索，也可**集成到既有搜索系统**(如传统 SQL 数据库)中，充当专用的向量搜索引擎。","locale":"zh"},"3014":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"Zvec 经历了阿里巴巴集团严苛的**生产级工作负载验证**，提供**高可靠**、**低延迟**和**可扩展**的相似度搜索。得益于极简的依赖与纯进程内嵌入式的设计，Zvec 具备极高的通用性，可广泛覆盖各类应用场景：","locale":"zh"},"3015":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"💻 从**快速原型**和**本地开发**","locale":"zh"},"3016":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"📱 到**嵌入式应用**和**边缘部署**","locale":"zh"},"3017":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"🌐 再到**超十亿级规模的生产系统**","locale":"zh"},"3018":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"⚡ **极致高效**：毫秒级响应，轻松检索数十亿级向量。","locale":"zh"},"3019":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🧩 **开箱即用**：纯本地运行 — 安装后几分钟内就能开始搜索。无需服务器、无需复杂配置。","locale":"zh"},"3020":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"✨ **稠密 + 稀疏向量**：支持稠密向量和稀疏向量，提供多向量联合查询的原生支持。","locale":"zh"},"3021":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🎯 **混合搜索**：向量语义搜索 + 标量条件过滤，获得精确结果。","locale":"zh"},"3022":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🛡️ **持久存储**：WAL 预写日志保障数据持久性 — 即使进程崩溃或意外断电，数据也不会丢失。","locale":"zh"},"3023":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🔒 **并发访问**：支持多进程同时读取同一个 Collection；写入为单进程独占模式。","locale":"zh"},"3024":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"📦 **进程内运行**：无需单独部署服务，纯进程内运行。Notebook、高性能服务器、CLI 工具、边缘设备 — 随处可用。","locale":"zh"},"3025":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Jupyter Notebook 教程\" href=\"/downloads/walkthrough-zh.zip\" description=\"运行多模态图像检索的交互式教程\" icon=\"<Download className=&#x22;text-teal-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"3026":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content"