cs/zvec-grep/agents#检索路由","content":"外部信息源，而非 Zvec-Grep","locale":"zh"},"3352":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents#检索路由","content":"默认 Agent 工具集只暴露索引检索。索引缺失时，支持交互式设置的客户端可以提示用户选择模型并批准后台构建，构建完成后重试搜索。不支持该交互时，请先运行 `zg --index`；重建和删除仍需显式执行。","locale":"zh"},"3353":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/agents#移除","content":"该操作只移除 Zvec-Grep 管理的 Agent 配置，不会删除 npm 包或工作区索引。如果安装或连接失败，请查看故障排查。","locale":"zh"},"3354":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"page","content":"Benchmark","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec-Grep","性能"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","locale":"zh"},"3355":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"了解 Zvec-Grep 在受控 Agent 评测中对回答质量、上下文消耗、工具调用和完成时间的影响。","locale":"zh"},"3356":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"结果概览","locale":"zh"},"3357":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"评测哪些指标","locale":"zh"},"3358":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#2-两套评测","content":"两套评测","locale":"zh"},"3359":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"SWE-QA-Bench","locale":"zh"},"3360":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plu