h/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"代码理解 · SWE-QA-Bench","locale":"zh"},"3371":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**+1.50 pp**","locale":"zh"},"3372":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−47.3%**","locale":"zh"},"3373":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−58.6%**","locale":"zh"},"3374":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−37.5%**","locale":"zh"},"3375":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"通用文本 · BrowseComp-Plus","locale":"zh"},"3376":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**+0.33 pp**","locale":"zh"},"3377":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−37.56%**","locale":"zh"},"3378":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−43.52%**","locale":"zh"},"3379":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−38.58%**","locale":"zh"},"3380":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"代码评测包含 11 个仓库中的 20 个任务，每组配置运行三次；通用文本评测包含 100,195 篇文档上的 80 个样例，每组配置运行两次。","locale":"zh"},"3381":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"**回答质量：** 任务对应的 Judge 得分或准确率。","locale":"zh"},"3382":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"**输入 Token：** Agent 完成任务时消耗的模型上下文。","locale":"zh"},"3383":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"**工具调用：** 执行轨迹中记录的搜索与内容读取次数。","locale":"zh"},"3384":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"**Agent 耗时：** 不包含 Zvec-Grep 索引准备时间的任务执行耗时。","locale":"zh"},"3385":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-评测哪些指标","content":"回答质量应保持稳定或提升；Token、工具调用和执行时间则越低越好。","locale":"zh"},"3386":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"评测代码仓库级、跨文件和多跳的软件工程问答。它面向相关实现分散在多个文件、且入口位置事先未知的问题。","locale":"zh"},"3387":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"查看 SWE-QA-Bench 配置与评测方法","locale":"zh"},"3388":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"在固定的大规模文本语料上评测多文档证据检索与回答准确率，观察语义与词法联合排序能否在不降低答案质量的前提下减少大范围文档扫描。","locale":"zh"},"3389":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"查看 BrowseComp-Plus 配置与评测方法","locale":"zh"},"3390":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-如何理解结果","content":"这些结果反映的是“为 Agent 工作流增加 Zvec-Grep”带来的影响，不是单次 CLI 查询延迟对比。Agent 行为存在随机性，因此多次运行的均值比单次结果更有参考价值。","locale":"zh"},"3391":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-如何理解结果","content":"当任务需要语义发现、跨文件归纳或从大量文档中组合证据时，效率收益通常更明显。对于已知字面量或符号，原生 ripgrep 仍可能是最直接的路径。","locale":"zh"},"3392":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-复现评测","content":"两套评测都固定了输入和依赖，将生成产物隔离在 Agent 可见工作区之外，并分别提供运行、评测和报告流程。","locale":"zh"},"3393":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-复现评测","content":"查看完整 Benchmark 文档","locale":"zh"},"3394":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI 参考","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec-Grep","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","locale":"zh"},"3395":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","content":"查找 zg 的主要命令和内置参考，覆盖检索、索引、配置与 AI Agent 接入。","locale":"zh"},"3396":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli#命令地图","content":"命令地图","locale":"zh"},"3397":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli#常用起点","content":"常用起点","locale":"zh"},"3398":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/cli-3","page_