ec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#远程-embedding-被拒绝","content":"单次命令可以使用 `--allow-remote`；内容不能离开本机时，请选择本地模型。","locale":"zh"},"3710":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#安全重置","content":"`--drop` 会删除工作区索引，但不会删除源码文件。在重新构建索引前，索引检索将不可用。","locale":"zh"},"3711":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#安全重置","content":"反馈问题时，请提供版本、操作系统、失败命令、相关的 `zg --status` 和脱敏后的诊断信息，并移除凭据、私有路径和敏感片段。","locale":"zh"},"3712":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#安全重置","content":"提交 Zvec-Grep Issue","locale":"zh"},"3713":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP 服务器","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","面向 Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","locale":"zh"},"3714":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp#快速配置","content":"快速配置","locale":"zh"},"3715":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp#qoder推荐","content":"Qoder（推荐）","locale":"zh"},"3716":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp#claude-code","content":"Claude Code","locale":"zh"},"3717":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp#claude-desktop","content":"Claude Desktop","locale":"zh"},"3718":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/agents/mcp#本地开发","content":"本地开发","lo