s/open-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"3926":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"使用 `open()` 函数从磁盘加载已有的 collection。","locale":"zh"},"3927":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"指定的路径**必须指向一个已有的 Zvec collection**。如果未找到有效的 collection，`open()` 将抛出错误。","locale":"zh"},"3928":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`path`：Collection 目录的具体路径。","locale":"zh"},"3929":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`option`：控制运行时行为的配置。","locale":"zh"},"3930":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`read_only`：以只读模式打开 collection。在此模式下，任何写入尝试均会触发错误异常。","locale":"zh"},"3931":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"当需要在多个进程间共享集合时，请使用只读模式。这能确保并发访问的安全性，有效规避数据损坏的风险。","locale":"zh"},"3932":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`enable_mmap`：\n启用内存映射 I/O 以加速数据访问 (默认为 `True`)。该机制通过略微增加内存缓存的占用，来换取显著的性能提升。","locale":"zh"},"3933":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"page","content":"优化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","locale":"zh"},"3934":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"为什么需要优化","locale":"zh"},"3935":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#使用示例","content":"使用示例","locale":"zh"},"3936":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"检查索引状态","locale":"zh"},"3937":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"何时调用 `optimize()`","locale":"zh"},"3938":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","content":"`optimize()` 方法将 Flat 暂存区中累积的向量合并构建到配置的向量索引中，从而**提升检索性能**。该操作在**后台运行**，**不会阻塞读取或写入操作**，从而确保应用程序始终保持响应。","locale":"zh"},"3939":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"在 Zvec 中，新插入的向量**不会直接**添加到已配置的向量索引中。这些新向量会先被暂存到一个轻量级的 Flat 索引 (暴力检索)缓冲区。","locale":"zh"},"3940":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"这种设计带来了显著的优势，但也伴随着一定的取舍:","locale":"zh"},"3941":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"✅ **优势**","locale":"zh"},"3942":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**最大化写入吞吐量**：实现高速数据写入。","locale":"zh"},"3943":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**流式写入**：为原生不支持流式增量更新的索引类型 (如 IVF)，提供实时写入的能力。","locale":"zh"},"3944":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"⚠️ **取舍**","locale":"zh"},"3945":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**搜索性能随写入量衰减**：随着 Flat 暂存区增长，搜索性能会下降。","locale":"zh"},"3946":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"🔁 **解决方案**","locale":"zh"},"3947":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"定期调用 `optimize()`。这会触发后台工作线程，将暂存区中的向量合并到已配置的向量索引中 — 且**不会中断正在进行的读写操作**。🚀","locale":"zh"},"3948":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"`optimize()` **不会锁定 collection**。优化过程中，其他线程和操作可以继续无感地读取、写入和查询 — 应用程序将保持完全响应。","locale":"zh"},"3949":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"使用 `stats` 属性获取 collection 索引状态的实时信息：","locale":"zh"},"3950":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`doc_count`：当前存储的 document 总数。","locale":"zh"},"3951":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`index_completeness`：表示向量数据已建立索引的比例 (0.0\\~1.0)。","locale":"zh"},"3952":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`1.0` →  该向量字段的所有向量均已建立索引","locale":"zh"},"3953":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`0.0` → 尚未进行任何索引；所有向量仍暂存在 Flat 缓冲区中，并通过暴力检索进行查询","locale":"zh"},"3954":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"**介于两者之间** → 部分向量已构建索引，或正在索引中","locale":"zh"},"3955":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**定期**执行优化，但**不宜过于频繁**：","locale":"zh"},"3956":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**频率过低** → Flat 缓冲区过大，导致检索性能下降","locale":"zh"},"3957":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**频率过高** → 浪费资源，过早优化小批量数据","locale":"zh"},"3958":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"请根据您的**数据写入速率**和**查询延迟要求**进行权衡。","locale":"zh"},"3959":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**最佳实践：**\\\n如果感觉检索速度变慢，请检查 collection 索引状态。\\\n原则上，建议在**未索引 documents 数量达到10万条以上时**进行优化 — 但请务必根据您的具体业务场景灵活调整。","locale":"zh"},"3960":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"page","content":"Schema 演进","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","locale":"zh"},"3961":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"数据定义语言（DDL）","locale":"zh"},"3962":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"前置条件","locale":"zh"},"3963":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#column-ddl","content":"Column DDL","locale":"zh"},"3964":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"添加列","locale":"zh"},"3965":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"删除列","locale":"zh"},"3966":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#修改列","content":"修改列","locale":"zh"},"3967":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"查看当前 Schema","locale":"zh"},"3968":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#index-ddl","content":"Index DDL","locale":"zh"},"3969":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"创建索引","locale":"zh"},"3970":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"删除索引","locale":"zh"},"3971":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"Zvec 支持**动态 Schema 演进**，允许你在 Collection 创建后修改其结构——无需停机、数据重新导入或重新索引。","locale":"zh"},"3972":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"支持的操作：","locale":"zh"},"3973":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **添加或删除标量字段**","locale":"zh"},"3974":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **重命名字段**或**更改数据类型**（需确保变更安全，如从 `INT32` 到 `INT64`）","locale":"zh"},"3975":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **创建或删除字段索引**","locale":"zh"},"3976":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"❌  添加或删除向量字段（🔜 即将支持）","locale":"zh"},"3977":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"在 Zvec 中，Schema 变更通过\\*\\*数据定义语言（DDL）\\*\\*方法执行，分为两类：","locale":"zh"},"3978":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Column DDL**：定义*你存储什么数据*。\n管理 Collection 的结构，包括添加、删除、重命名或修改字段。","locale":"zh"},"3979":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Index DDL**：定义*你如何搜索数据*。\n控制字段上索引的创建和删除。","locale":"zh"},"3980":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"💡 **Zvec 索引规则**","locale":"zh"},"3981":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**每个向量字段都必须建索引**，使用合适的向量索引以支持相似度搜索。","locale":"zh"},"3982":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**标量字段索引是可选的**——但你应该为计划在过滤查询中使用的标量字段建立倒排索引（如 `WHERE category = 'music'`）。","locale":"zh"},"3983":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"本指南假设你已打开一个 Collection 并准备好了 `collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"3984":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"该示例 Collection 包含一个标量字段 `publish_year`。","locale":"zh"},"3985":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"使用 `add_column()` 向已有 Collection 添加新的标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3986":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`field_schema`：\n定义新字段的名称和数据类型。详见标量字段 Schema。","locale":"zh"},"3987":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`expression`：\n为已有 Document 指定默认值。由于已有 Document 没有 `rating` 字段，Zvec 使用此 `expression` 填充缺失值——本例中将所有现有 Document 的 `rating` 设为 5。","locale":"zh"},"3988":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"目前仅支持通过 `add_column()` 添加**数值型标量字段**。对 `string` 和 `boolean` 类型的支持即将推出。\n因此，`expression` 必须求值为数字——可以是单个数字字面量（如 `\"5\"`）或涉及已有数值字段的简单算术表达式（如 `\"publish_year + 1\"`）。","locale":"zh"},"3989":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"使用 `drop_column()` 永久删除标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3990":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"此操作会**从 Collection 中每个 Document 删除该字段及其所有数据**。该操作**不可逆**。","locale":"zh"},"3991":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#修改列","content":"使用 `alter_column()` 重命名列或更新其 Schema：","locale":"zh"},"3992":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"修改完成后，你可以随时打印 Schema 来查看 Collection 的当前结构：","locale":"zh"},"3993":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"详见 Schema 示例。","locale":"zh"},"3994":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"你可以使用 `create_index()` 在**向量**和**标量**字段上创建（或替换）索引以加速搜索：","locale":"zh"},"3995":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"**向量字段**必须使用以下索引类型之一：","locale":"zh"},"3996":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`HnswIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3997":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`HnswRabitqIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3998":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`IVFIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3999":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`FlatIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"4000":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"**标量字段**使用 `InvertIndexParam` 以启用高效过滤。","locale":"zh"},"4001":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"使用 `drop_index()` 删除标量字段上的索引：","locale":"zh"},"4002":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"**不允许删除向量字段的索引**。\n在 Zvec 中，每个向量字段必须始终有且仅有一个索引以支持相似度搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4003":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"page","content":"数据结构","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","locale":"zh"},"4004":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","content":"Zvec 如何通过 collection、document、schema 和索引来组织数据。","locale":"zh"},"4005":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"Collections","locale":"zh"},"4006":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"为什么要使用 Collection？","locale":"zh"},"4007":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"持久化","locale":"zh"},"4008":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#documents","content":"Documents","locale":"zh"},"4009":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"Document 的结构","locale":"zh"},"4010":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"Document 示例","locale":"zh"},"4011":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"数据类型","locale":"zh"},"4012":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"标量类型","locale":"zh"},"4013":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"向量类型","locale":"zh"},"4014":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"索引","locale":"zh"},"4015":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","content":"Zvec 采用 **Collection** 和 **Document** 的结构来组织数据。","locale":"zh"},"4016":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**Collection** 是用来存放 documents 的具名容器 — 类似于关系型数据库 (如 MySQL) 中的**数据表**，其中每个 **document** 对应表中的**一行**。Collection 用于存储、组织和查询数据。","locale":"zh"},"4017":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"每个 Collection 由一个 **Schema** 定义，Schema 描述了其包含的标量字段和向量及其类型和索引设置。","locale":"zh"},"4018":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**同一个 collection 中的所有 documents 都必须遵循相同的 schema**。","locale":"zh"},"4019":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"Zvec 中的 collection schema 是**动态的**：你可以随时添加或删除标量字段和向量，无需重建 collection。","locale":"zh"},"4020":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**不支持跨 collection 查询**：不支持 Join、Union 或多 collection 检索。请据此合理设计你的数据模型。","locale":"zh"},"4021":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"Collection 提供了**隔离**，确保每个业务场景都拥有独立的 schema 和索引配置。这种隔离既避免了不同业务之间的相互干扰，也让它们可以独立调整。","locale":"zh"},"4022":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"例如：","locale":"zh"},"4023":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**检索增强生成（RAG）collection** 可能存储文本向量以及元数据 — 如标题、章节、源 URL 和最后更新时间戳。","locale":"zh"},"4024":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**图片搜索 collection** 可以存储高维度的图片向量以及相关字段，如图片 ID、文件路径或描述。","locale":"zh"},"4025":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"**每个 collection 独立持久化在磁盘上的专属目录中**，从而在不同的业务场景之间提供隔离。","locale":"zh"},"4026":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"每个 collection **完全自包含于其目录中**。这意味着你可以自由迁移 collection 的文件夹，只需提供正确的路径，Zvec 就能顺利加载它。","locale":"zh"},"4027":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#documents","content":"Document 是数据存储的基本单元 — 类似于关系型数据库表中的一条记录或一行。每个 document 都存在于一个 collection 中，并且必须符合该 collection 的 schema。","locale":"zh"},"4028":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"Document 是由三个核心部分组成的**结构化**对象。","locale":"zh"},"4029":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🔑 `id`：Document 的唯一字符串标识符，在 document 被写入后不可修改","locale":"zh"},"4030":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"📐 `vectors`：一组具名向量","locale":"zh"},"4031":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🗂️ `fields`：一组具名标量 (非向量) 字段，可包含字符串、数值、布尔值或这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"4032":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"这个 document 属于一个定义了如下 schema 的 collection：","locale":"zh"},"4033":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"两个稠密向量：`vector_1`（4 维）和 `vector_2`（6 维）","locale":"zh"},"4034":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"一个稀疏向量：`vector_3`","locale":"zh"},"4035":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"标量字段：`category`（字符串）、`price`（整数）和 `languages`（字符串数组）","locale":"zh"},"4036":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"**所有字段必须符合 schema 中声明的类型**。向量必须匹配指定的类型(稠密或稀疏)和维度(例如，768维的向量字段不能接受512维的向量)。","locale":"zh"},"4037":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"Document 插入后，可以通过 `upsert()` 或局部 `update()` 操作进行更新，但所有修改仍必须遵守 collection schema 约束。","locale":"zh"},"4038":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"Zvec 实现了强类型的 schema 系统，并使用 `DataType` 枚举，其支持的类型可分为以下两类:","locale":"zh"},"4039":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**标量类型** — 字符串、整数、浮点数、布尔值以及这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"4040":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**向量类型** — 稠密向量和稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"4041":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**数据写入阶段会执行类型安全检查**：Document 内的每个字段都必须严格符合其声明的 `DataType`。","locale":"zh"},"4042":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"基础类型","locale":"zh"},"4043":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`STRING`","locale":"zh"},"4044":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`BOOL`","locale":"zh"},"4045":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT32`","locale":"zh"},"4046":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT64`","locale":"zh"},"4047":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`UINT32`","locale":"zh"},"4048":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeli