locale":"zh"},"4279":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Marco Rossi","locale":"zh"},"4280":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"4281":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"有了这些索引，查询变得极其高效 ✨：","locale":"zh"},"4282":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查找所有意大利菜谱\" → 在 `cuisine` 索引中查找 \"Italian\" → `[1, 4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"4283":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查看 Marco Rossi 的菜谱\" → 在 `author` 索引中查找 \"Marco Rossi\" → `[4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"4284":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查找 Julia Chen 的意大利菜谱\" → 取交集 `[1, 4, 5]` 和 `[1, 6]` → `[1]`","locale":"zh"},"4285":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"我们**不对 `url` 建立索引**，因为它很少用于查询。对其建立索引会浪费存储空间并减慢写入速度，而收益甚微。一旦我们有了 Document ID，可以直接从原始数据中获取其 `url`。","locale":"zh"},"4286":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"因为它将标准映射进行了反转：","locale":"zh"},"4287":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-81","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"方向","locale":"zh"},"4288":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-82","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"映射","locale":"zh"},"4289":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-83","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"正向","locale":"zh"},"4290":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-84","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"Document ID → 词项列表","locale":"zh"},"4291":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-85","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"倒排","locale":"zh"},"4292":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-86","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"词项 → Document ID 列表","locale":"zh"},"4293":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-87","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"这种反转使得基于关键词的搜索变得高效。无需检查每个 Document 是否包含查询词项，而是直接跳转到该词项并立即获取所有匹配的 Document。","locale":"zh"},"4294":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-88","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"虽然倒排索引功能强大，但也有一定代价：","locale":"zh"},"4295":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-89","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **存储开销**：索引需要额外的存储空间。","locale":"zh"},"4296":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-90","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作 — `INSERT`、`UPSERT` 和 `UPDATE` — 都需要维护索引，增加了写入延迟和 I/O 负载。","locale":"zh"},"4297":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"page","content":"向量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","locale":"zh"},"4298":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","content":"非结构化数据的数值表示，用于捕捉语义信息以支持相似度检索。","locale":"zh"},"4299":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"什么是向量？","locale":"zh"},"4300":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"如何在数据库中使用向量？","locale":"zh"},"4301":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"向量如何赋能应用？","locale":"zh"},"4302":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"什么是 Embedding 模型？","locale":"zh"},"4303":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量类型","content":"向量类型","locale":"zh"},"4304":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"稠密向量","locale":"zh"},"4305":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"4306":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"在人工智能与向量数据库的语境下，&#x2A;**向量是由 embedding 模型生成的一组数字，用于捕捉非结构化数据的语义信息*** — 例如文本、图片或音频。","locale":"zh"},"4307":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"这些模型将原始输入映射到一个高维空间中，&#x2A;**使得语义相似的内容能够生成相近的向量***，从而让 AI 系统能够基于含义进行比较，而不再局限于关键词匹配。","locale":"zh"},"4308":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"🗂️ **存储**：用 embedding 模型将数据 (如文档、商品图片或用户画像) 转化为向量，并存入向量数据库。","locale":"zh"},"4309":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"🔍 **搜索**：当收到新的查询请求时 (例如一段文本或一张图片)，用相同的 embedding 模型将其转化为**查询向量**，随后使用数据库检索并返回与之最相似的向量。","locale":"zh"},"4310":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"借助高效的索引机制，即使在大规模数据场景下，数据库也能迅速返回相关结果。这正是语义搜索的核心：**寻找含义相同的内容，而非仅仅是文字相同的内容**。","locale":"zh"},"4311":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"**图像搜索**就是一个绝佳的例子：","locale":"zh"},"4312":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"每张图像都会被转化为一个向量，用来捕捉其形状、色彩和物体类别等视觉特征。","locale":"zh"},"4313":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"**视觉或语义上相似的图像会生成相近的向量**。","locale":"zh"},"4314":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"通过比较这些向量，搜索系统能够：","locale":"zh"},"4315":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"✅ **在不同照片中识别同一个人**：即使光照、姿势或表情发生变化，同一个人的照片也会生成相似的向量，这让系统能够可靠地匹配身份。","locale":"zh"},"4316":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"✅ **在电商平台中查找相似商品**：当用户拍摄一件裙子、灯具或沙发的照片时，系统会将其向量与商品库中的向量进行比对，并检索出外观或风格相似的商品。","locale":"zh"},"4317":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"这一切都得益于向量数据库提供的高效的向量相似度检索功能。","locale":"zh"},"4318":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"Embedding 模型是一种将原始数据转化为向量的 AI 模型 — 正如顶部示意图所示。","locale":"zh"},"4319":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"这些模型通过海量训练数据学习内在规律，确保语义相似的对象在向量空间中生成的向量彼此邻近 — 通常使用**余弦相似度**、**点积**或**欧氏距离**等距离度量来衡量。","locale":"zh"},"4320":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"**距离度量的选择至关重要。** 如果 embedding 模型是基于特定度量标准 (如余弦相似度) 训练的，那么在向量数据库中进行搜索时，也必须使用相同的度量标准，才能保证语义关系的准确性，从而获得最优的搜索结果。","locale":"zh"},"4321":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"若要探索和比较最新的 embedding 模型，你可以查看 Hugging Face 的 Embedding 排行榜，该榜单评估了数百种模型在不同任务和语言环境下的表现。","locale":"zh"},"4322":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量类型","content":"向量主要分为两类：**稠密向量**和**稀疏向量**，它们各自以独特的方式捕捉数据特征。","locale":"zh"},"4323":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"稠密向量是固定长度的实值数组，其(几乎)每一个维度都承载着语义信息。这类向量通常由深度学习模型生成，这些模型将文本、图像、音频等原始输入转化为结构化的向量空间，从而反映出它们在语义上的相似性。","locale":"zh"},"4324":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"**✅ 语义丰富**：能够理解上下文和深层含义 (例如，\"国王 – 男人 + 女人 ≈ 皇后\")","locale":"zh"},"4325":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"**⚠️ 不可解释**：难以直观判断究竟是哪些特征导致了相似性","locale":"zh"},"4326":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"稀疏向量通常是极高维的 (维度大小往往等同于词汇表大小)，但其中只有极少部分维度是非零值。每一个被激活的维度都对应一个特定的词项 (如单词或 n-gram)，并带有如 **BM25** 之类的相关性权重。","locale":"zh"},"4327":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"在这种模型下，每篇文档都会被转化为一个向量 — 称为文档向量 — 用于记录其中出现了哪些词项以及它们的重要性。同样地，搜索查询也会使用相同的加权方案转化为稀疏向量。","locale":"zh"},"4328":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"与精确关键词匹配不同，查询与文档之间的相似度是通过计算两者向量的点积得出的。这种方式衡量的是加权词项的匹配程度：包含了与查询相同且重要的词项的文档会获得更高的分数 — 从而同时兼顾了词项的**重叠度**和**重要性**。","locale":"zh"},"4329":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"为了计算效率，稀疏向量使用整数索引将词项映射到词表字典中的位置，而不直接存储词项字符串。","locale":"zh"},"4330":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"**✅ 可解释性强**：非零维度直接对应已知的词项 (例如，`4017` → \"puppy\")","locale":"zh"},"4331":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"**⚠️ 缺乏语义理解**：除非建立明确关联，否则会将 \"car\" 和 \"automobile\" 视为互不相关的词","locale":"zh"},"4332":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","type":"page","content":"删除","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","数据操作"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","locale":"zh"},"4333":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"按 ID 删除","locale":"zh"},"4334":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/del