,"locale":"zh"},"4344":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"基于字段值批量删除——适用于清理符合特定条件的 Document","locale":"zh"},"4345":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"删除操作是**即时**且**不可逆**的。\n执行删除前请务必仔细核对输入。","locale":"zh"},"4346":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"假设你已打开 Collection 并准备好 `collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"4347":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"使用 `delete()` 在已知确切 ID 时删除一个或多个 Document。","locale":"zh"},"4348":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"传入单个 `id` 时，`delete()` 返回一个 `Status` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"4349":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"传入 `id` 列表时，返回相同顺序的 `Status` 对象列表。","locale":"zh"},"4350":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按筛选条件删除","content":"使用 `delete_by_filter()` 删除所有匹配布尔 `filter` 表达式的 Document。","locale":"zh"},"4351":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按筛选条件删除","content":"`filter` 可以引用标量字段（如 `publish_year`、`language`），使用比较和逻辑运算符。","locale":"zh"},"4352":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operati