（`includeVector`）：是否读取向量数据。默认读取向量；如果只需要标量字段，将其关闭可以加快遍历速度。","locale":"zh"},"4429":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"`iter_docs()` 与 `iterDocsSync()` 遍历的都是**调用时刻创建的隔离快照**：","locale":"zh"},"4430":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"迭代器创建**之后**写入的数据（`insert`、`upsert`、`update`）对该迭代器**不可见**。","locale":"zh"},"4431":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"创建之后的删除不影响遍历；创建快照时已被删除的 Document 会被过滤掉。","locale":"zh"},"4432":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"对于可写 Collection，创建迭代器可能会封存（seal）当前写入段（每次调用都可能产生一个新的小段）；只读 Collection 则直接扫描，不写入任何数据。","locale":"zh"},"4433":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"遍历顺序未定义——它**不是**插入顺序，且在 `optimize()` 重组段之后可能改变，因此切勿依赖它。","locale":"zh"},"4434":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"当 Collection 上有迭代器处于打开状态时，以下操作会**报错**：","locale":"zh"},"4435":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"Schema 变更——创建或删除索引，以及新增、修改、删除列","locale":"zh"},"4436":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"`optimize()`，它会在启动时立即失败","locale":"zh"},"4437":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"`close()` 或 `destroy()` Collection","locale":"zh"},"4438":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"反之，当上述某个维护操作正在运行时，创建迭代器同样会失败。写入、`flush()`、`query()` 与 `fetch()` 均**不受影响**。","locale":"zh"},"4439":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"关闭 Collection 之前，请先关闭所有迭代器；所有迭代器关闭后，上述限制立即解除。","locale":"zh"},"4440":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#提前结束遍历","content":"提前停止是安全的——退出 `with` 块或 `for...of` 循环即会释放迭代器占用的槽位。如果你手动驱动迭代器，则需自行关闭：","locale":"zh"},"4441":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","type":"page","content":"Update","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","数据操作"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","locale":"zh"},"4442":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#document-doc","content":"Document `Doc`","locale":"zh"},"4443":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"更新单个 Document","locale":"zh"},"4444":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#批量更新-document","content":"