s":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`name`：collection 的标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4550":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`fields`：标量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4551":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`vectors`：向量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4552":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#collection-名称-step","content":"Collection 标识符。此名称用于内部引用和日志记录。","locale":"zh"},"4553":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"标量字段存储非向量（即结构化）数据，如字符串、数字、布尔值或数组。","locale":"zh"},"4554":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"每个字段通过 `FieldSchema` 定义，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4555":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`name`：字段在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4556":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`data_type`：存储的数据类型 — 如 `STRING`、`INT64` 或数组类型 `ARRAY_STRING`。","locale":"zh"},"4557":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`nullable` (可选)：是否允许该字段为**空值** (默认为 `False`)。","locale":"zh"},"4558":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`index_param` (可选)：通过 `InvertIndexParam` 创建倒排索引实现快速过滤，或通过 `FtsIndexParam` 创建全文索引实现全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4559":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"请为需要检索的标量字段添加索引。未索引的字段能节省存储和写入开销。","locale":"zh"},"4560":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**倒排索引** (`InvertIndexParam`)，还可以选择性地开启一些能提升性能 (但会增加存储成本) 的功能：","locale":"zh"},"4561":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_range_optimization=True` → 加速范围查询 (如 `price > 100`)","locale":"zh"},"4562":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_extended_wildcard=True` → 支持复杂的字符串模式匹配 (如 `name LIKE 'abc%def'`)","locale":"zh"},"4563":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**全文索引** (`FtsIndexParam`)，需要配置分词器和 Token 过滤器。详见全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4564":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"使用 `InvertIndexParam()` 配置倒排索引。","locale":"zh"},"4565":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"使用 `FtsIndexParam()` 配置全文索引。","locale":"zh"},"4566":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"使用 `VectorSchema` 定义向量字段，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4567":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`name`：向量在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4568":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`data_type`：向量的数值格式。","locale":"zh"},"4569":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稠密向量：`VECTOR_FP32`、`VECTOR_FP16` 等。","locale":"zh"},"4570":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稀疏向量：`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP32`、`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP16`。","locale":"zh"},"4571":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`dimension`：向量维度 (稠密向量必填项)。","locale":"zh"},"4572":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`index_param`：用于配置向量索引的类型及相似度度量标准。","locale":"zh"},"4573":