create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"示例使用合成向量以便独立运行；实际使用时请导入有代表性的嵌入向量。写入数据后，`collection.optimize()` 训练码本并构建 PQ 索引。优化前的查询使用原始 Flat 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4581":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"接着运行 PQ 查询与精排示例，即可搜索此 Collection。IVF-PQ4、FastScan 及参数权衡参见乘积量化（PQ）。","locale":"zh"},"4582":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `HnswRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 HNSW-RaBitQ 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4583":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IVFIndexParam()` 配置 IVF 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4584":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IvfRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 IVF-RaBitQ 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4585":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `DiskAnnIndexParam()` 配置 DiskANN 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4586":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#完整-schema-示例","content":"以下示例使用倒排索引和 HNSW 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4587":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"page","content":"DiskANN 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","locale":"zh"},"4588":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"面向十亿级近似最近邻搜索的磁盘图索引，以较低 QPS 为代价，在大幅降低内存占用的同时保持较高 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4589":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4590":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"何时使用 DiskANN 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4591":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4592":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4593":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4594":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4595":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4596":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"一种基于磁盘的图索引，专为**十亿级**向量搜索设计 — 将压缩向量保存在内存中，全精度向量存储在磁盘上，实现高 Recall 的近似最近邻搜索，同时**大幅降低内存占用**。","locale":"zh"},"4597":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"DiskANN 由 Subramanya 等人在 NeurIPS 2019 论文 DiskANN: Fast Accurate Billion-point Nearest Neighbor Search on a Single Node 中提出。","locale":"zh"},"4598":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**`libaio` 为可选依赖。** 如果系统已安装 `libaio`，DiskANN 会使用 Linux 异步 I/O 以获得更好的性能；如果未安装，DiskANN 仍可通过备用 I/O 路径正常运行，但查询性能可能略低。","locale":"zh"},"4599":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"不过，由于查询路径涉及磁盘 I/O，DiskANN 的 **QPS 低于纯内存索引**（如 HNSW），因此更适合对吞吐和延迟不敏感、但需要在受限内存下处理超大规模数据的场景。","locale":"zh"},"4600":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"DiskANN 在完整数据集上构建 Vamana 图，并将其与原始向量一起存储在磁盘上。搜索时，仅 PQ（乘积量化）压缩编码驻留在内存中，图和全精度向量按需从磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4601":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**Vamana 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4602":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"单层图结构，每个节点最多连接 `max_degree` 个邻居。","locale":"zh"},"4603":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"图的构建采用贪心搜索-剪枝策略，通过 **alpha 参数**鼓励长距离边，实现快速收敛到查询点的邻域。","locale":"zh"},"4604":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**中心点**（medoid，距数据集质心最近的点）作为每次搜索的固定入口。","locale":"zh"},"4605":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**乘积量化（PQ）用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4606":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"向量空间被划分为 `pq_chunk_num` 个子空间，每个子向量被量化为 256 个质心的码本（8-bit PQ 编码）。","locale":"zh"},"4607":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"查询时，预先计算查询向量的 **PQ 距离查找表**，通过快速表查找而非全精度运算来计算候选点的近似距离。","locale":"zh"},"4608":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**带缓存的束搜索** 🔎","locale":"zh"},"4609":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"搜索从中心点开始，使用**束搜索**（beam search）策略探索图 — 多个前沿节点通过批量磁盘 I/O 并发扩展。","locale":"zh"},"4610":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"入口点附近的高频访问节点被缓存在内存中（**BFS 层级缓存**），减少热点区域的磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4611":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"对于每个访问的节点，使用 PQ 编码计算近似距离，并从磁盘读取全精度向量为 top-k 候选结果计算精确距离。","locale":"zh"},"4612":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ **无法完全装入内存**的十亿级数据集","locale":"zh"},"4613":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 对成本敏感、需要最小化内存消耗的部署场景","locale":"zh"},"4614":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 可以容忍相比内存索引稍高延迟的批处理工作负载和离线分析","locale":"zh"},"4615":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：当数据集远超可用内存时使用 DiskANN。它以仅与 PQ 编码成比例的内存消耗提供出色的 Recall。如果数据集可以装入内存，建议使用 HNSW 或 HNSW-RaBitQ 以获得更低延迟。","locale":"zh"},"4616":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **极低的内存占用** — 仅 PQ 压缩编码（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）驻留内存，使十亿级搜索在普通硬件上成为可能","locale":"zh"},"4617":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **高 Recall** — Vamana 图通过基于 alpha 的剪枝保持连通性和多样性，最终候选结果重新计算精确距离","locale":"zh"},"4618":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **可扩展的图构建** — 采用简单的贪心插入-剪枝算法，可跨线程并行化","locale":"zh"},"4619":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢","locale":"zh"},"4620":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4621":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景","locale":"zh"},"4622":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始。先调整查询时的 `list_size` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要更好 Recall 时增加 `max_degree` — 但预期会增加磁盘占用和构建时间。如果需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall，可减少 `pq_chunk_num`。","locale":"zh"},"4623":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4624":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4625":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4626":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4627":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4628":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4629":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`max_degree`","locale":"zh"},"4630":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — Vamana 图中每个节点的最大边数","locale":"zh"},"4631":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `max_degree` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多磁盘占用和更长的构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4632":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4633":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建时候选列表大小** — 插入新向量时图构建过程中考虑的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4634":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4635":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`pq_chunk_num`","locale":"zh"},"4636":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**PQ 子空间数量** — 控制向量维度如何划分以进行乘积量化","locale":"zh"},"4637":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多 chunk →  ✨ 更精细的距离近似和更好的 Recall  ⚠️ PQ 编码占用更多内存（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）","locale":"zh"},"4638":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4639":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4640":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4641":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4642":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时候选列表大小** — 束搜索图遍历时维护的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4643":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更多磁盘 I/O 和更高的查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4644":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"page","content":"Flat 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","locale":"zh"},"4645":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","content":"相似性检索的基线","locale":"zh"},"4646":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4647":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"何时使用 Flat 索引","locale":"zh"},"4648":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4649":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"局限","locale":"zh"},"4650":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"通过将查询向量与数据集中的所有向量逐一比对，实现精确相似性检索 (暴力检索)。","locale":"zh"},"4651":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 小规模数据集","locale":"zh"},"4652":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 原型设计与实验阶段","locale":"zh"},"4653":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 作为评估基准","locale":"zh"},"4654":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 对召回率要求 100% 且不可妥协的场景","locale":"zh"},"4655":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：在开发和测试阶段，建议先使用 Flat 索引 — 把它当作你的正确性基准。一旦方案验证通过，再考虑使用近似索引 (如 HNSW) 来获得生产级别的性能。对于数据量极小 (比如30万条向量的规模) 且正确性优于速度的场景，Flat Index 也是一个完全可行的选择。","locale":"zh"},"4656":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **完美 Recall 保证** — 能找到真正的最近邻","locale":"zh"},"4657":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **零配置** — 简单设置，无需调参","locale":"zh"},"4658":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **即时索引** — 构建时间几乎为零","locale":"zh"},"4659":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"⚠️ 搜索延迟随数据量大小呈线性增长 —  这意味着它难以支撑大规模的工作负载。","locale":"zh"},"4660":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","locale":"zh"},"4661":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","content":"一种基于图结构的索引，也是实现低延迟相似度检索的首选方案 — 它以较高的内存占用为代价，提供了业界顶尖的检索速度和召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4662":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4663":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"何时使用 HNSW 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4664":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4665":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4666":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4667":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4668":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4669":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW 构建了一个**多层图结构**，其中每个节点代表一个向量，节点间的边则根据相似度建立连接。","locale":"zh"},"4670":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"层级化的多层布局 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4671":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**上层**：结构稀疏且节点较少，充当“高速公路”，用于实现快速的长距离导航。","locale":"zh"},"4672":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**下层**：结构稠密且包含更多节点，提供细粒度的局部邻域连接。","locale":"zh"},"4673":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"搜索过程（从粗粒度到细粒度）🔍","locale":"zh"},"4674":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"从顶层的**入口节点**开始。","locale":"zh"},"4675":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在当前层，以贪心策略走向距离查询向量更近的邻居节点，直到无法再接近为止。","locale":"zh"},"4676":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"然后在该位置**下降一层**，并重复同样的贪心搜索的过程。","locale":"zh"},"4677":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在**最底层**，以更精细的搜索策略执行该过程 (使用候选集列表)，以得到更准确的结果。","locale":"zh"},"4678":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**为什么 HNSW 既快又准** ⚡ 🎯","locale":"zh"},"4679":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**快**：上层结构可以快速跳转到目标区域，无需遍历绝大多数节点。","locale":"zh"},"4680":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**准**：底层结构稠密，能对局部邻域进行精细化搜索，从而保证高召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4681":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 实时、低延迟应用 (如对话式 AI 和实时推荐系统)","locale":"zh"},"4682":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 需要在极低延迟下保持高召回率的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4683":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：HNSW 是我们针对大多数生产环境**推荐的首选方案**。它在速度、准确性和稳定性之间取得了极佳的平衡。","locale":"zh"},"4684":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ **近似于对数级的查询时间** — 对于大型数据集，通常能达到 &#x2A;*O(log n)** 的效率","locale":"zh"},"4685":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 具备极强的适应性，在多种数据分布下**均能维持高召回率**","locale":"zh"},"4686":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 索引**构建速度比许多替代方案都要快** (如基于 IVF 的方法)","locale":"zh"},"4687":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)","locale":"zh"},"4688":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)","locale":"zh"},"4689":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"如需使用 PQ4 或 PQ8 压缩向量，参见乘积量化（PQ），了解参数配置、OPQ 训练和查询精排。","locale":"zh"},"4690":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：先从默认值开始，然后优先调整 `ef` 来平衡召回率和延迟。只有在必要时，才增加 `ef_construction` 或 `m` 来提升精度 — 这会降低索引构建的速度并增加内存使用。","locale":"zh"},"4691":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4692":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4693":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4694":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4695":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4696":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4697":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4698":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 构建图过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向连接数量","locale":"zh"},"4699":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-38","page_id":"/zh/doc