index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：想要剔除掉低质量匹配的结果  🚫 不适用于：必须返回全部 top-K 个结果，不关心分数质量","locale":"zh"},"4715":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4716":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性检索** (不使用配置的索引)","locale":"zh"},"4717":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、超小数据集或验证索引准确性","locale":"zh"},"4718":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4719":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"对头部候选结果**启用精排** (重新计算精确的相似度分数) — 在开启了**量化**的场景下有帮助，能挽回精度损失，提高召回质量","locale":"zh"},"4720":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"✅ 在启用量化的场景下，如需得到更高精度时开启精排  ⚠️ 注意：因为要重新精确计算分数，所以会增加查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4721":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","locale":"zh"},"4722":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW + RaBitQ 量化","locale":"zh"},"4723":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4724":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"何时使用 HNSW-RaBitQ？","locale":"zh"},"4725":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4726":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4727":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4728":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4729":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4730":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"一种先进的基于图的索引，将 HNSW 图结构与 RaBitQ 量化算法相结合 — 在保持一流搜索质量的同时**大幅降低内存使用**。","locale":"zh"},"4731":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 支持 Linux 和 macOS 的 x86\\_64 / ARM64、Windows x86\\_64、Android arm64-v8a 和 iOS ARM64。x86\\_64 的 CPU 需支持 AVX2/FMA 或 AVX-512（F/BW/DQ），Zvec 会在运行时自动选择可用实现；ARM64 使用 NEON。","locale":"zh"},"4732":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 结合两项技术实现高 Recall 和低内存占用：","locale":"zh"},"4733":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**HNSW 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4734":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"与标准 HNSW 索引相同的多层图结构 — 上层稀疏用于快速远距离跳转，下层密集用于细粒度局部搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4735":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**RaBitQ 用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4736":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"RaBitQ 先对向量进行**随机旋转**，然后将其转换为**二进制编码**（0 和 1）。这种方法允许系统通过高效的位运算来估计距离，与处理全精度数值相比，显著**降低了内存使用和计算成本**。","locale":"zh"},"4737":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 需要快速搜索、高 Recall 且内存预算可控的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4738":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 超大规模高维数据集 — 十亿级 1536+ 维向量在 FP32 格式下会消耗 TB 级内存","locale":"zh"},"4739":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"**最佳实践**：当你希望获得 HNSW 级别的搜索质量而无需承担高内存开销时，使用 HNSW-RaBitQ。","locale":"zh"},"4740":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"`total_bits` 参数控制精度-内存的权衡。根据论文，在特定数据集上，**7 位**可达约 99% Recall，**5 位**约 95%，**4 位**约 90%。最低可使用 **1 位**以最大化压缩，但会降低 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4741":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **大幅降低内存** — 量化后的向量最多比 FP32 小 32 倍，减少活跃索引大小","locale":"zh"},"4742":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **高效距离估计** — RaBitQ 支持基于位运算的高效相似度计算","locale":"zh"},"4743":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **无需重排序即可获得出色 Recall** — 图构建使用原始向量，保持图质量；RaBitQ 提供渐近最优的误差界，确保排序可靠","locale":"zh"},"4744":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4745":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量","locale":"zh"},"4746":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始（`total_bits=7`，`num_clusters=16`）。先调整查询时的 `ef` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall 时减小 `total_bits`。","locale":"zh"},"4747":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4748":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4749":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4750":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4751":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的相似度度量","locale":"zh"},"4752":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4753":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 图构建过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向链接数","locale":"zh"},"4755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多内存使用，索引和搜索延迟更高","locale":"zh"},"4756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**索引时候选池大小** — 插入新向量时算法考虑的候选邻居数","locale":"zh"},"4758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间（*不影响查询速度*）","locale":"zh"},"4759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`total_bits`","locale":"zh"},"4760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**RaBitQ 每维量化位数** — 控制二进制编码精度","locale":"zh"},"4761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"控制精度-内存权衡。 更低的值节省更多内存但降低精度","locale":"zh"},"4762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`num_clusters`","locale":"zh"},"4763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**KMeans 聚类数** — 在 RaBitQ 训练阶段用于划分向量空间","locale":"zh"},"4764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多聚类可捕获更精细的分布模式  • 更高的值可略微提升 Recall","locale":"zh"},"4765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`sample_count`","locale":"zh"},"4766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**训练样本数** — KMeans 训练采样的向量数量（`0` = 使用全部向量）","locale":"zh"},"4767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认为 `0`。在超大数据集上设置较小的值（如 5,000,000）可加速训练并减少内存使用","locale":"zh"},"4768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4769":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4770":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"te