-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#查询精排","content":"精排会使用参考向量重新计算已召回候选的分数，改善近似检索后的排序。下方的 HNSW-PQ8 示例和上方的 IVF-RaBitQ 示例都使用了精排。","locale":"zh"},"5509":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#查询精排","content":"`is_using_refiner=True` 用于开启候选结果的重新打分。","locale":"zh"},"5510":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#查询精排","content":"`scale_factor` 控制进入精排的候选数量。例如 `topk=10`、`scale_factor=4` 时，检索会请求约 40 个候选，重新打分后返回最优的 10 条。增大此值会增加候选打分开销。","locale":"zh"},"5511":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#查询精排","content":"需要 **Python SDK 0.8.1 或更高版本**。先运行 HNSW-PQ8 创建示例，再在同一工作目录下运行以下代码。它会打开 `./hnsw_pq` 并返回 10 条精排结果。","locale":"zh"},"5512":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#查询精排","content":"结合 `ef` 调整 `scale_factor`，以权衡召回率和延迟。精排仅对已召回候选重新排序，无法找回未进入候选集的近邻。相关权衡参见乘积量化（PQ）。","locale":"zh"},"5513":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"page","content":"量化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引","量化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","locale":"zh"},"5514":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"存储行为","locale":"zh"},"5515":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"量化类型","locale":"zh"},"5516":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种压缩技术，&#x2A;**它将向量从原始格式 (如 FP32) 转换为更紧凑的表示形式***，从而减小用于检索的向量索引的大小。","locale":"zh"},"5517":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"这种转换通过更紧凑的逐维编码或子向量编码来近似原始向量，从而实现：","locale":"zh"},"5518":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更低的**内存占用** — 尤其当索引常驻内存时；","locale":"zh"},"5519":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更快的 I/O 速度和更低的查询延迟 — 减少了数据传输开销，还充分利用了高效的整数或半精度浮点 (FP16) 计算；","locale":"zh"},"5520":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 在资源受限的硬件上实现更好的可扩展性。","locale":"zh"},"5521":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"**重要**：","locale":"zh"},"5522":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种**有损且不可逆**的压缩方法。它以**可能降低召回率为代价**，换取更高的运行时效率。请务必验证其对检索质量的影响。","locale":"zh"},"5523":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化仅在应用于 **FP32** 格式的向量时才能带来收益。","locale":"zh"},"5524":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"为确保数据完整性和灵活性，**Zvec 同时存储原始向量及其量化版本**。这意味着：","locale":"zh"},"5525":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"**磁盘上的总存储占用可能会增加** (因为保存了两份副本)。","locale":"zh"},"5526":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"**量化编码可以减少检索时的向量内存占用**。PQ 训练仍需读取原始向量，查询精排则需要读取参考向量以重新计算候选分数。","locale":"zh"},"5527":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"用户随时都能按需取回**原始的完整向量**。","locale":"zh"},"5528":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"Zvec 提供两类量化方法：\\*\\*标量量化（SQ）\\*\\*对每个维度独立编码，\\*\\*乘积量化（PQ）\\*\\*则对子向量中的一组维度联合编码。","locale":"zh"},"5529":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"类型","locale":"zh"},"5530":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"表示方式","locale":"zh"},"5531":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"配置与示例","locale":"zh"},"5532":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"标量量化（SQ）","locale":"zh"},"5533":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"使用较低精度的数值表示每个维度","locale":"zh"},"5534":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"FP16、INT8、INT4 及可选的随机旋转","locale":"zh"},"5535":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"乘积量化（PQ）","locale":"zh"},"5536":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"使用训练码本中的编码表示子向量","locale":"zh"},"5537":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"PQ4、PQ8、可选的 OPQ 及 IVF-PQ4 FastScan","locale":"zh"},"5538":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"根据内存预算与检索质量要求选择量化方法，再使用有代表性的数据评估召回率和延迟。具体配置、SDK 要求和示例见对应子页面。","locale":"zh"},"5539":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"page","content":"乘积量化（PQ）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引","量化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","locale":"zh"},"5540":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","content":"为 HNSW 和 IVF 索引配置 PQ4、PQ8、OPQ 与 IVF FastScan。","locale":"zh"},"5541":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"编码大小与精度","locale":"zh"},"5542":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"配置参数","locale":"zh"},"5543":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"FastScan 执行路径","locale":"zh"},"5544":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#训练与生命周期","content":"训练与生命周期","locale":"zh"},"5545":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#查询与精排","content":"查询与精排","locale":"zh"},"5546":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用量化","content":"启用量化","locale":"zh"},"5547":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用旋转","content":"启用旋转","locale":"zh"},"5548":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","content":"乘积量化（Product Quantization，PQ）将每个向量划分为 `num_chunk` 个子向量，再用训练得到的码本中的编码表示每个子向量。与逐维压缩的标量量化不同，PQ 对一组维度进行联合压缩。","locale":"zh"},"5549":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","content":"Zvec 的 PQ 支持 **HNSW 和 IVF** 索引、**稠密 FP32 向量**以及 **L2、IP、COSINE** 距离度量。","locale":"zh"},"5550":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","content":"Python 从 **0.8.1** 起支持 HNSW/IVF 的 PQ 配置；**Node.js SDK 0.8.0** 尚未提供 PQ 配置选项。本页示例使用 Python API。","locale":"zh"},"5551":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"先选择**编码位数**，再按需开启优化。PQ4/PQ8、OPQ 和 FastScan 是不同层面的配置，并非四种互相替代的量化方法。","locale":"zh"},"5552":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"**选择 PQ4 或 PQ8**：通过 `num_bits` 设置。PQ4 每个子向量使用 4 位编码（16 个码本条目），PQ8 使用 8 位编码（256 个条目）。","locale":"zh"},"5553":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"**按需启用 OPQ**：设置 `enable_rotate=True`。优化乘积量化通过学习旋转来减小量化误差，可与 PQ4 或 PQ8 组合。","locale":"zh"},"5554":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"**使用 IVF-PQ4 时，可选启用 FastScan**：设置 `fast_scan=True`，以扫描紧凑编码。4 位编码与寄存器查表的背景可参见 Faiss FastScan 文档。Zvec 的此选项要求 IVF 且 `num_bits=4`，不适用于 HNSW 或 PQ8。","locale":"zh"},"5555":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"每个向量的编码大小约为 `num_chunk × num_bits / 8` 字节。例如，768 维 FP32 向量的原始大小为 3,072 字节；划分为 96 个子向量后，PQ8 编码占 96 字节，PQ4 编码占 48 字节。这些数字不包含码本、索引结构、元数据及保留的原始向量，**不代表整个 Collection 的内存或磁盘占用**。","locale":"zh"},"5556":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#编码大小与精度","content":"增加子向量数量或编码位数通常可以保留更多信息，但也会增加存储和计算开销。请使用实际数据评估召回率与延迟。","locale":"zh"},"5557":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"5558":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"默认值","locale":"zh"},"5559":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"含义与约束","locale":"zh"},"5560":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`num_chunk`","locale":"zh"},"5561":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`8`","locale":"zh"},"5562":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"子向量数量，必须为正数且不大于向量维度。使用 PQ4 时，向量维度必须能被该值整除。","locale":"zh"},"5563":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`num_bits`","locale":"zh"},"5564":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`8`","locale":"zh"},"5565":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"每个子向量的编码位数，只支持 `4` 或 `8`。","locale":"zh"},"5566":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`enable_rotate`","locale":"zh"},"5567":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`False`","locale":"zh"},"5568":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"为 PQ 启用学习得到的 OPQ 旋转，与 INT8/INT4 标量量化使用的随机旋转不同。","locale":"zh"},"5569":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`fast_scan`","locale":"zh"},"5570":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`False`","locale":"zh"},"5571":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"启用 FastScan，**仅支持 IVF + PQ4**；HNSW 和 PQ8 不支持此选项。","locale":"zh"},"5572":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`opq_iter`","locale":"zh"},"5573":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`5`","locale":"zh"},"5574":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"OPQ 训练迭代次数，启用 OPQ 时必须为正数。","locale":"zh"},"5575":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`opq_pq_iter`","locale":"zh"},"5576":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"`4`","locale":"zh"},"5577":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"每次 OPQ 迭代中的 PQ 训练迭代次数，启用 OPQ 时必须为正数。","locale":"zh"},"5578":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#配置参数","content":"配置 IVF-PQ4 FastScan 时，在 128 维字段的 `IVFIndexParam` 中设置 `quantize_type=QuantizeType.PQ`，并传入 `QuantizerParam(num_chunk=16, num_bits=4, fast_scan=True)`。如需 OPQ，再加上 `enable_rotate=True`。各平台可用性参见平台矩阵。","locale":"zh"},"5579":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"**功能可用性与 SIMD 加速是两个层面。** FastScan 仅适用于 IVF-PQ4。v0.8.1 的内核分派实现根据 CPU 能力选择执行路径：","locale":"zh"},"5580":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"CPU 能力","locale":"zh"},"5581":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"FastScan 执行路径","locale":"zh"},"5582":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"x86\\_64，支持 AVX512F 和 AVX512BW","locale":"zh"},"5583":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"AVX-512","locale":"zh"},"5584":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"x86\\_64，支持 AVX2","locale":"zh"},"5585":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"AVX2","locale":"zh"},"5586":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"ARM64，支持 NEON","locale":"zh"},"5587":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"NEON","locale":"zh"},"5588":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"无匹配的 SIMD 路径","locale":"zh"},"5589":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"标量回退","locale":"zh"},"5590":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#fastscan-执行路径","content":"构建时也需要包含相应的 SIMD 实现。缺少上述指令集本身不等于 PQ 或 FastScan 不可用，因为实现提供了标量回退。标量回退也不代表不同 CPU 的性能相同。","locale":"zh"},"5591":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#训练与生命周期","content":"PQ 在 `Collection.optimize()` 时训练。优化前，未训练的数据仍可通过原始 Flat 索引查询。应先写入有代表性的数据再执行优化；仅创建 PQ Schema 不会得到已训练的压缩索引。","locale":"zh"},"5592":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#训练与生命周期","content":"关闭并重新打开 Collection 后，训练好的码本与量化配置会保留。以可写方式打开的 Collection 也支持后续更新；随着数据变化，可以通过优化训练和重建索引。","locale":"zh"},"5593":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#训练与生命周期","content":"使用普通 IVF-PQ4 时，设置 `fast_scan=False`；使用 IVF-PQ8 时，还需设置 `num_bits=8`。","locale":"zh"},"5594":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#查询与精排","content":"PQ 检索使用近似距离。启用 `is_using_refiner` 后，会使用参考向量重新计算候选结果的分数。`scale_factor` 控制候选扩展倍数：设为 4 时，会在精排前请求约 `topk` 四倍的候选结果。","locale":"zh"},"5595":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#查询与精排","content":"精排会增加参考向量读取和打分开销。它可以改善已召回候选的排序，但无法找回未进入候选集的近邻。请结合 HNSW 的 `ef` 或 IVF 的 `nprobe` 调整 `scale_factor`，同时评估召回率和延迟。","locale":"zh"},"5596":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#查询与精排","content":"索引生命周期的更多说明，参见 HNSW、IVF 和 Collection 优化。","locale":"zh"},"5597":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用量化","content":"在传给 `VectorSchema.index_param` 的 `HnswIndexParam` 或 `IVFIndexParam&#x60; 中，设置 &#x2A;*`quantize_type=zvec.QuantizeType.PQ`**，并通过 `quantizer_param` 传入 `zvec.QuantizerParam` 来配置 PQ。","locale":"zh"},"5598":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用量化","content":"配置 Schema 后，先写入有代表性的数据，再调用 `collection.optimize()` 训练码本并构建 PQ 索引。优化前的查询使用原始 Flat 索引。完整流程参见 HNSW-PQ8 创建示例。","locale":"zh"},"5599":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用旋转","content":"使用 PQ 时，在索引参数的 `quantizer_param&#x60; 中设置 &#x2A;*`enable_rotate=True`**，即可启用&#x2A;*优化乘积量化（OPQ）**。OPQ 通过训练数据学习旋转，以减小量化误差；INT8/INT4 标量量化使用的则是随机正交旋转。该选项默认为 `False`，可与 PQ4 或 PQ8 组合，也可独立于 IVF-PQ4 FastScan 启用。","locale":"zh"},"5600":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/product-quantization#启用旋转","content":"写入有代表性的数据后，调用 `collection.optimize()` 进行训练。OPQ 会增加训练开销，可通过 `opq_iter` 和 `opq_pq_iter` 控制迭代次数。请使用实际数据评估启用 OPQ 后的召回率与训练耗时。","locale":"zh"},"5601":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"page","content":"标量量化（SQ）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引","量化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","locale":"zh"},"5602":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","content":"配置 FP16、INT8、INT4 标量量化与随机旋转。","locale":"zh"},"5603":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#量化类型","content":"量化类型","locale":"zh"},"5604":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#fp16半精度浮点","content":"FP16（半精度浮点）","locale":"zh"},"5605":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#int88-位整数量化","content":"INT8（8 位整数量化）","locale":"zh"},"5606":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#int44-位整数量化","content":"INT4（4 位整数量化）","locale":"zh"},"5607":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#启用量化","content":"启用量化","locale":"zh"},"5608":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#启用旋转","content":"启用旋转","locale":"zh"},"5609":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","content":"标量量化（Scalar Quantization，SQ）分别降低向量每个维度的表示精度。FP16 使用更紧凑的浮点表示，INT8 和 INT4 使用整数量化。与对子向量联合编码的乘积量化（PQ）不同，SQ 对每个维度独立编码。","locale":"zh"},"5610":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#fp16半精度浮点","content":"将 FP32 源向量转换为 16 位浮点表示，以降低数值精度为代价，减小向量表示的大小。请使用实际数据评估召回率和延迟，确认 FP16 是否满足检索质量要求。","locale":"zh"},"5611":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#int88-位整数量化","content":"将 FP32 源向量转换为 8 位整数表示，减小向量表示的大小和内存带宽需求。量化会引入近似误差，选择 INT8 时应评估召回率和延迟。","locale":"zh"},"5612":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#int44-位整数量化","content":"将 FP32 源向量转换为 4 位整数表示。与 INT8 相比，INT4 每个维度使用的位数更少，但可能引入更多量化误差。内存受限时可以考虑使用，并验证其对召回率和延迟的影响。","locale":"zh"},"5613":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#启用量化","content":"在传给 `VectorSchema.index_param` 的索引参数对象（如 `HnswIndexParam` 或 `IVFIndexParam`）中，将 `quantize_type` 设置为 `FP16`、`INT8` 或 `INT4`。SQ 是这类量化方法的统称，API 使用各具体类型的名称。","locale":"zh"},"5614":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#启用量化","content":"INT8 的配置方式参见 HNSW Schema 示例。Zvec 会在保留原始向量的同时管理量化表示，存储与内存开销参见存储行为。","locale":"zh"},"5615":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization/scalar-quantization#启用旋转","content":"在启用 `INT8` 或 `INT4` 量化时，你可以通过在索引参数对象中设置 `quantizer_param` 参数，**指定 `enable_rotate=True` 来开启旋转**。该功能会在量化前对向量施加一次随机正交旋转，使数值在各维度间分布得更均匀，有助于减小量化误差；对召回率的影响需使用实际数据评估。对于 PQ，该选项启用的是学习得到的 OPQ 旋转。","locale":"zh"}},"count":5615},"sorting":{"language":"multilingual","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":3300,"2":2402,"3":2151,"4":3430,"5":2442,"6":2230,"7":4118,"8":2797,"9":2142,"10":2903,"11":2286,"12":2154,"13":3917,"14":2517,"15":757,"16":2775,"17":759,"18":2186,"19":3479,"20":1055,"21":1053,"22":1054,"23":2248,"24":3332,"25":3334,"26":2352,"27":2356,"28":3482,"29":3365,"30":3523,"31":2350,"32":2354,"33":382,"34":2245,"35":2159,"36":4027,"37":3297,"38":98,"39":96,"40":2742,"41":264,"42":287,"43":158,"44":2730,"45":179,"46":4028,"47":2